## Features Summary

| Feature | Implementation |
|---------|---------------|
| **Multiple Rooms** | Join/leave/create rooms dynamically |
| **Nicknames** | Set on connect, changeable anytime |
| **Message History** | Last 50 messages per room (in-memory) |
| **Typing Indicators** | Real-time broadcast with auto-timeout |
| **System Messages** | User joined/left notifications |
| **Message Format** | JSON with type, room, user, content, timestamp |

