## Architecture Overview

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                    HTTP Server (:8080)                   │
│                  Serves client.html                     │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  WebSocket Server                       │
│                                                         │
│  ┌─────────────┐    ┌──────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │   clients    │    │          rooms                │   │
│  │  Map<ws,     │    │  Map<roomName, {             │   │
│  │   {nickname, │    │    clients: Set<ws>,          │   │
│  │    room}>    │    │    history: Message[50],      │   │
│  │             │    │    typingUsers: Map<ws,timer>  │   │
│  └─────────────┘    │  }>                           │   │
│                      └──────────────────────────────┘   │
├─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│                  Message Protocol (JSON)                │
│                                                         │
│  Client → Server:                                       │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │ setNick   { type, content: "name" }              │   │
│  │ join      { type, room: "roomname" }             │   │
│  │ leave     { type }                               │   │
│  │ message   { type, content: "text" }              │   │
│  │ typing    { type }                               │   │
│  │ stopTyping{ type }                               │   │
│  │ getRooms  { type }                               │   │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
│                                                         │
│  Server → Client:                                       │
│  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────┐   │
│  │ welcome   Initial greeting                       │   │
│  │ nickSet   Nickname confirmed                     │   │
│  │ joined    Room join confirmed + history sent     │   │
│  │ left      Room leave confirmed                   │   │
│  │ message   { type, room, user, content, ts }      │   │
│  │ system    Join/leave/rename notifications        │   │
│  │ history   Last 50 messages array                 │   │
│  │ userlist  Current room members array             │   │
│  │ roomList  All active rooms with user counts      │   │
│  │ typing    Array of currently-typing usernames    │   │
│  │ error     Error description                      │   │
│  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────┘   │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

## Key Features

| Feature | Implementation |
|---|---|
| **Multiple rooms** | In-memory `Map<roomName, Room>` — users join/leave freely, empty rooms auto-delete |
| **Nicknames** | Set before joining any room, validated (alphanumeric, unique), changeable |
| **Message history** | Circular buffer of 50 messages per room, sent on join as `history` message |
| **Typing indicators** | Client sends `typing`/`stopTyping`, server broadcasts per-room with 3s auto-expire timeout |
| **System messages** | Generated server-side for join/leave/rename events, stored in history |
| **Reconnection** | Client auto-reconnects with exponential backoff (up to 5 attempts) |
| **Input sanitization** | Nicknames and room names stripped of special chars; messages capped at 1000 chars; HTML escaped on render |

Of course. Here is a complete WebSocket chat server and a corresponding HTML/JS client that meet all the specified requirements.

