This premium responsive navigation system includes:

**Desktop Features:**
- Horizontal navigation with logo, links, and dropdown menus
- Smooth CSS animations for dropdowns
- Active state indicators with animated underline
- Sticky navigation with backdrop blur effect on scroll
- Premium gradient CTA button with hover effects

**Mobile Features:**
- Animated hamburger menu button (transforms to X)
- Full-screen slide-in menu from the right
- Staggered animations for menu items
- Accordion submenus with smooth transitions
- Semi-transparent overlay
- Body scroll lock when menu is open

**Accessibility:**
- Full keyboard navigation support
- Proper ARIA attributes (aria-expanded, aria-haspopup, role attributes)
- Focus indicators for all interactive elements
- Skip to main content link
- Semantic HTML structure

**Technical Highlights:**
- Pure CSS animations (no animation libraries)
- Minimal vanilla JavaScript (only for toggles and state management)
- Smooth transitions throughout
- Responsive breakpoint at 768px
- Modern CSS features (backdrop-filter, CSS variables, flexbox)
- Premium design with gradients, shadows, and blur effects

The navigation automatically adapts to screen size and provides a polished, professional experience on all devices.

