### Latency Characteristics

**Optimized for real-world networks:**

```javascript
// Update batching and compression
class YjsConnection {
  pendingUpdates = [];

  sendUpdate(update) {
    this.pendingUpdates.push(update);

    // Batch updates over 50ms window
    if (!this.batchTimer) {
      this.batchTimer = setTimeout(() => {
        const merged = Y.mergeUpdates(this.pendingUpdates);
        const compressed = Y.encodeStateAsUpdate(merged);

        // Typical compression: 70-90% size reduction
        this.websocket.send(compressed);

        this.pendingUpdates = [];
        this.batchTimer = null;
      }, 50);
    }
  }
}
```

**Latency profile:**
```
Local edit:     0ms (immediate)
Batch window:   0-50ms (configurable)
Network:        20-100ms (peer-to-peer or via server)
Apply remote:   <1ms (efficient merge)

Total perceived latency: 20-150ms
```

